ko</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    New York, 1972. In John Lennon and Yoko Ono’s apartment, the television is always on, serving as a ‘window to the world.’ Through their TV,&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/tintin-the-lake-of-sharks/\" title=\"Tintin &amp; the Lake of Sharks\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/01/tintin-the-lake-of-sharks-460x275.webp' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Kids &amp; Families</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 26 Apr            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/tintin-the-lake-of-sharks/\" title=\"Tintin &amp; the Lake of Sharks\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Tintin &amp; the Lake of Sharks</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Tintin and his friends visit Professor Calculus, who is experimenting with new technology at his country laboratory, only to find him and a pair of&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-unfaithful-wife/\" title=\"The Unfaithful Wife\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"car