o&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/houdini/\" title=\"Houdini\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/houdini-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Kids &amp; Families</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 4 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/houdini/\" title=\"Houdini\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Houdini</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    How did Harry become the famous Harry Houdini? Based on the real story of the world-renowned hero of magic. Harry, 12 years old, has lived&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/les-enfants-du-paradis/\" title=\"Les Enfants du paradis\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/les-enfants-du-paradis-2-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"t