         <h3 class=\"card__title\">Blue Road &#8211; The Edna O&#8217;Brien Story</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    In 1960, a young Irish woman named Edna O’Brien wrote a sexually frank debut novel, The Country Girls. She became a literary sensation, writing for&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/les-biches/\" title=\"Les Biches\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/02/chabrol-les-biches-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                6 & 11 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/les-biches/\" title=\"Les Biches\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Les Biches</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    + intro by Prof. Richard Dyer (King’s College London) on 6 May                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/acting/\" title=\"Acting\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/acting-2-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Wed 7 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/acting/\" title=\"Acting\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Acting</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    + Q&amp;A with Declan Donnellan, Nick Ormerod &amp; Sophie Fiennes                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ocean-with-david-attenborough/\" title=\"Ocean with David Attenborough\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/04/oceans-david-attenborough-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 8 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ocean-with-david-attenborough/\" title=\"Ocean with David Attenborough\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Ocean with David Attenborough</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    This compelling documentary takes viewers on a breath-taking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise,&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/limonov-the-ballad-of-eddie/\" title=\"Limonov: The Ballad of Eddie\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/limonov-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 9 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/limonov-the-ballad-of-eddie/\" title=\"Limonov: The Ballad of Eddie\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Limonov: The Ballad of Eddie</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Presented in competition at the 2024 Cannes Film Festival, Serebrennikov’s latest film is based on the novel Limonov by acclaimed French writer Emmanuel Carrère. A&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/\" title=\"Riefenstahl\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/riefenstahl-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 9 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/\" title=\"Riefenstahl\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Riefenstahl</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Leni Riefenstahl, the director of Triumph of the Will and Olympia, is considered one of the most controversial photography and film figures of the twentieth&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ethel-ernest/\" title=\"Ethel &amp; Ernest\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/ethel-ernest-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Kids &amp; Families</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 10 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ethel-ernest/\" title=\"Ethel &amp; Ernest\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Ethel &amp; Ernest</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Ethel and Ernest is adapted from Raymond Briggs’s graphic novel, telling the true story of his parents. They were two ordinary Londoners who fell in&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/hot-milk/\" title=\"Hot Milk\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/hot-milk-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 10 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/hot-milk/\" title=\"Hot Milk\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Hot Milk</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    After writing a number of films (Ida, Disobedience), Rebecca Lenkiewiczs' directorial debut is a poetic adaptation of Deborah Levy’s Booker Prize-nominated novel of the same&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/yannick/\" title=\"Yannick\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/yannick-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 10 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/yannick/\" title=\"Yannick\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Yannick</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Prolific director Quentin Dupieux (The Second Act) returns with yet another absurd and metaphysical comedy reflecting on the act of acting. In the middle of&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/a-monster-in-paris/\" title=\"A Monster in Paris\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/monster-in-paris-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Kids &amp; Families</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 11 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/a-monster-in-paris/\" title=\"A Monster in Paris\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">A Monster in Paris</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    This tribute to both Beauty &amp; the Beast and The Phantom of the Opera transports us to the Paris of 1910 where cabaret singer Lucille&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/opening-night/\" title=\"Opening Night\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/opening-night-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sun 11 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/opening-night/\" title=\"Opening Night\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Opening Night</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    While in the midst of rehearsals for her latest play, Broadway actor Myrtle Gordon (Gena Rowlands) witnesses the accidental death of an adoring young fan,&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/t-s-eliots-four-quartets/\" title=\"T.S. Eliot’s Four Quartets\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/t-s-eliot-four-quartets-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Mon 12 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/t-s-eliots-four-quartets/\" title=\"T.S. Eliot’s Four Quartets\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">T.S. Eliot’s Four Quartets</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    + Q&amp;A with Sophie and Ralph Fiennes                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/life-journeys-morag-ross-the-crying-game/\" title=\"Life Journeys: Morag Ross &amp; The Crying Game\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/04/the-crying-game-morag-ross-1-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Special Screenings</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Thu 15 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/life-journeys-morag-ross-the-crying-game/\" title=\"Life Journeys: Morag Ross &amp; The Crying Game\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Life Journeys: Morag Ross &amp; The Crying Game</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    A legend in the film industry, Morag Ross is the award-winning make-up designer who creates the look of characters of some of the most distinctive&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/e-1027-eileen-gray-and-the-house-by-the-sea/\" title=\"E.1027: Eileen Gray and the House by the Sea\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/e-1027-eileen-gray-and-the-house-by-the-sea-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Arts</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 16 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/e-1027-eileen-gray-and-the-house-by-the-sea/\" title=\"E.1027: Eileen Gray and the House by the Sea\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">E.1027: Eileen Gray and the House by the Sea</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    The Irish artist and architect Eileen Gray had a truly eminent sense of design. She created some of the most iconic furniture of the 20th&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-marching-band/\" title=\"The Marching Band\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/the-marching-band-460x275.webp' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 16 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-marching-band/\" title=\"The Marching Band\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">The Marching Band</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Thibaut is an internationally renowned conductor who travels the world. When he learns he was adopted, he discovers the existence of a younger brother, Jimmy,&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/\" title=\"Jane Austen Wrecked My Life\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 17 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/\" title=\"Jane Austen Wrecked My Life\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Jane Austen Wrecked My Life</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    The hopelessly clumsy yet charming and full of contradictions Agathe finds herself in desperate singlehood. Her dream is to experience love akin to a Jane&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-last-metro/\" title=\"The Last Metro\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/the-last-metro-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 18 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-last-metro/\" title=\"The Last Metro\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">The Last Metro</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    In occupied Paris, all Marion Steiner can think about is rehearsals for a new play she is staging at the Montmartre Theatre, where she has&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/hola-frida/\" title=\"Hola Frida!\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/frida-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Kids &amp; Families</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 24 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/hola-frida/\" title=\"Hola Frida!\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Hola Frida!</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Hola Frida! is the story of a little girl who is different. Her world is Coyoacan, Mexico City. Sparkling &amp; vibrant, everything interests her and&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/to-be-or-not-to-be/\" title=\"To Be or Not to Be\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/04/to-be-or-not-to-be-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                25 & 29 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/to-be-or-not-to-be/\" title=\"To Be or Not to Be\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">To Be or Not to Be</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    As nervy as it is hilarious, this screwball masterpiece from Ernst Lubitsch stars Jack Benny and, in her final screen appearance, Carole Lombard as husband-and-wife&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/miss-mary/\" title=\"Miss Mary\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/04/miss-mary-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Thu 29 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/miss-mary/\" title=\"Miss Mary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Miss Mary</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    A moody, perceptive period piece, it tells the story of a family that symbolises the oligarchy that ruled Argentina as if it were their personal&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/camila/\" title=\"Camila\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/04/camila-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 31 May            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/camila/\" title=\"Camila\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Camila</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Camila O’Gorman is a young woman raised within the confines of traditional upper-class values in mid-19th century Argentina, according to which virginity and dedication to&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/three-friends/\" title=\"Three Friends\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/trois-amies-460x275.webp' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 4 June            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/three-friends/\" title=\"Three Friends\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Three Friends</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Followed by a discussion with Emmanuel Mouret on 3 June                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n</div>    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tab\" id=\"tab-festivals\">\n    <div id=\"whats-on-festival-list\" class=\"card-list refresheable\">\n        <article class=\"card card--horizontal card--festival\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/highlights-of-the-month/\" title=\"Highlights of the Month\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thum