6/women-shaping-the-world-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Arts</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Books &amp; Ideas</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classical Music</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Talks</div>\n                            </div>\n            \n                        <span class=\"card__dates\">6 June - 21 Sept</span>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/women-shaping-the-world/\" title=\"Women Shaping the World\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Women Shaping the World</h3>\n            </a>\n\n                        <div class=\"next-event\">\n                <p>\n                    <strong>Next event : </strong> Holy Cow<br>\n                    <span>Fri 11 Apr at 18:40</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n            </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--festival\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/revisiting-chantal-akerman/\" title=\"Revisiting Chantal Akerman\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/01/je-tu-il-elle-460x275.webp' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                                <div class=\"t