me-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Margy Kinmonth’s feature documentary shines a light on the trailblazing role of women artists, on the front lines round the world, championing the female perspective on conflict through art and asking: when it&#8217;s life or death, what do women see that men don&#8217;t? Traditionally a male domain, war art by women has been largely unrecognised. [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/war-paint-women-at-war/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-03-26T15:59:20+00:00\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/war-paint.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/war-paint-women-at-war/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/war-paint-women-at-war/\",\"name\":\"War Paint – Women at War at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/war-paint-women-at-war/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/war-paint-women-at-war/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/war-paint.jpg\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-03-26T15