:description\" content=\"Watch Alain Guiraudie&#8217;s much anticipated film Misericordia, winner of the Prix Louis-Delluc, and hailed as the &#8216;Best Film of the Year” by Les Cahiers du cinéma. Alain Guiraudie (Stranger by the Lake) is one of the most unique and transgressive voices in French cinema today. A mixture of black comedy and melodrama, Misericordia reveals his penchant for genre-hopping and [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/misericordia/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-04-07T11:16:48+00:00\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/misericorde-1-jpg.webp\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/misericordia/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/misericordia/\",\"name\":\"Misericordia at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/misericordia/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/misericordia/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/misericorde-1-jpg.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-10-18T11:26:25+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-04-07