y=\"og:description\" content=\"Co-written with Audrey Diwan, Gilles Lellouche’s return to filmmaking after Sink or Swim, features an all-star French cast including Adèle Exarchopoulos, François Civil, Alain Chabat, Élodie Bouchez, Raphaël Quenard and Benoît Poelvoorde. In a troublesome neighbourhood in the North of France, local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, charmed by her fearless spirit [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/beating-hearts/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-04-07T12:07:22+00:00\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/L_amour-ouf-jpg.webp\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/beating-hearts/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/beating-hearts/\",\"name\":\"Beating Hearts at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/beating-hearts/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/beating-hearts/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/L_amour-ouf-jpg.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-10-18T11:28:56+00:00\",\"date