ta-page-id=\"626\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\"><span>Gazette Brasserie</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"42568\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/ticket-prices/\"><span>Ticket Prices</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-top-left\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/L_amour-ouf-jpg.webp')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WBdycs6ysCM&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"WBdycs6ysCM\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-top-left\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2024/10/L_amour-ouf-jpg.webp')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WBdycs6ysCM&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Beating Hearts</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Beating Hearts</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Wed 23 Apr to Wed 28 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    New Releases\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/highlights-of-the-month/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Highlights of the Month\">\n\t\t                    \tHighlights of the Month\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Co-written with Audrey Diwan, Gilles Lellouche’s return to filmmaking after <em>Sink or Swim</em>, features an all-star French cast including Adèle Exarchopoulos, François Civil, Alain Chabat, Élodie Bouchez, Raphaël Quenard and Benoît Poelvoorde.</p>\n<p>In a troublesome neighbourhood in the North of France, local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, charmed by her fearless spirit and sharp wit. As powerful first love blossoms between the two, rampant gang violence entices him into a much darker path and ultimately destroys all they have built. After many years apart, now leading profoundly different lives, the star-crossed lovers discover that every path they&#8217;ve taken leads them back together, but will love triumph over Clotaire&#8217;s quest for revenge?</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGilles Lellouche\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAdèle Exarchopoulos, François Civil, Benoît Poelvoorde, Alain Chabat, Élodie Bouchez, Raphaël Quenard, Vincent Lacoste, Jean-Pascal Zadi\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-film-line\"></i> Original title: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tL'Amour ouf\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFRA | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t165 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tin French with English subtitles\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-04-23\">\n\t                Wednesday 23 April\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"17:20\">\n\t            17:20\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6269817.TcsSection_1928774\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    \t<a href=\"#more-dates\" title=\"Check more dates\" data-fancybox class=\"button button-arrow button-outline\">Check more dates</a>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"more\" id=\"more-dat