\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-right\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/02/julie-keeps-quiet.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8SW2aRE1NLM&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Julie Keeps Quiet</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Julie Keeps Quiet</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Fri 25 Apr to Mon 05 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    New Releases\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>As the star player at an elite tennis academy, Julie’s life revolves around the game she loves. When her coach falls under investigation and is suddenly suspended, all of the club’s players are encouraged to speak up. But Julie decides to keep quiet&#8230;</p>\n<p>Van Dijl’s sparing and impactful direction creates an atmosphere of quiet between scenes of intense training sessions and confrontations between Julie and those around her seeking information, giving us the space to read between the lines and draw our own conclusions. Entirely gripping, it features a really terrific performance from real-life tennis player and first-time actor Van den Broeck, who telegraphs Julie’s strength, fragility, stoicism and disquiet in her every move.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLeonardo Van Dijl\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTessa Van den Broeck, Grace Biot, Alyssa Lorette\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBelgium-Sweden | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t100 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li s