oyaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"New York, 1972. In John Lennon and Yoko Ono’s apartment, the television is always on, serving as a ‘window to the world.’ Through their TV, this inventive documentary explores America at the time, the Lennons’ evolving politics, and their complex personal lives as they search for Yoko’s estranged daughter, Kyoko, against the backdrop of the [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/one-to-one-john-yoko/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-04-07T11:18:32+00:00\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/02/john-yoko-.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/one-to-one-john-yoko/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/one-to-one-john-yoko/\",\"name\":\"One to One: John &amp; Yoko at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/one-to-one-john-yoko/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/one-to-one-john-yoko/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/02/john-yoko-.jpg\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-02-24T15:56:09+0