Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Houdini</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Houdini</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Sun 04 to Sun 18 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    CinéFamilies\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/stage-on-screen/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Stage on Screen\">\n\t\t                    \tStage on Screen\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>How did Harry become the famous Harry Houdini? Based on the real story of the world-renowned hero of magic. Harry, 12 years old, has lived and breathed magic since his early childhood. Although he rehearses endlessly in his parents’ barn, he does realise that his dream is far stretched out. But his dreams get to reach when a real magician, the Great Tesla, invites him to New York to train on the big stage in front of audiences.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCédric Babouche\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFRA/BEL | 2014\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t52 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn English\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC 6+ \t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-04\">\n\t                Sunday 04 May\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière II</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"13:30\">\n\t            13:30\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6238757.TcsSection_3841519\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t 