dle-right\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/les-enfants-du-paradis-2.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Les Enfants du paradis</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Les Enfants du paradis</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Sun 04 to Thu 08 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Classics\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/stage-on-screen/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Stage on Screen\">\n\t\t                    \tStage on Screen\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Poetic realism reached sublime heights with <em>Les Enfants du paradis</em> (<em>Children of Paradise</em>), widely considered one of the greatest French films of all time.</p>\n<p>This nimble depiction of nineteenth-century Paris’s theatrical demimonde, filmed during World War II, follows a mysterious woman (Arletty) loved by four different men (all based on historical figures): an actor, a criminal, a count, and, most poignantly, a mime (Jean-Louis Barrault, in a longing-suffused performance for the ages). With sensitivity and dramatic élan, director Marcel Carné and screenwriter Jacques Prévert resurrect a world teeming with hucksters and aristocrats, thieves and courtesans, pimps and seers. And thanks to a major new restoration, this iconic classic looks and sounds richer and more detailed than ever.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMarcel Carné\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tArletty, Jean-Louis Barrault and Pierre Brasseur\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFRA | 1945\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t190 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn French with English subtitles\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPG\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-04\">\n\t                Sunday 04 May\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"13:00\">\n\t            13:00\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6262672.TcsSection_1928774\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    \t<a href=\"#more-dates\" title=\"Check more dates\" data-fancybox class=\"button button-arrow button-outline\">Check more dates</a>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"more\" id=\"more-dates\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>More Showings</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"desktop\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"min-width: 800px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Date</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Time</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Location</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th style=\"width: 100px\"></th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"date\" datetime=\"2025-05-04\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t            <strong>Sunday 04 May</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t        </time>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t