class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/blue-road.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Blue Road &#8211; The Edna O&#8217;Brien Story</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Blue Road &#8211; The Edna O&#8217;Brien Story</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Mon 05 to Wed 14 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Festivals &amp; Series\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/beyond-words/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Beyond Words\">\n\t\t                    \tBeyond Words\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>In 1960, a young Irish woman named Edna O’Brien wrote a sexually frank debut novel, <em>The Country Girls</em>. She became a literary sensation, writing for <em>The New Yorker</em>, delivering provocative interviews, and authoring screenplays. Her success enraged her writer husband and made her a pariah in her native Ireland, where her books were banned and burned.</p>\n<p>Granting the director access to her personal journals — read aloud in the film by the Oscar nominated Irish actress Jessie Buckley — and with additional perspectives offered from Gabriel Byrne, Walter Mosley and an array of renowned writers, Edna does not shy from any subject.</p>\n<p>Her final testimony, <em>Blue Road</em> is as candid, dark, and enchanting as O’Brien’s wonderful novels.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSinéad O’Shea\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIRL | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t99 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tin English\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-05\">\n\t                Monday 05 May\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière II</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"14:00\">\n\t            14:00\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6262054.TcsSection_3841519\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    \t<a href=\"#more-dates\" title=\"Check more dates\" data-fancybox class=\"button button-arrow button-outline\">Check more dates</a>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"more\" id=\"more-dates\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>More Showings</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"desktop\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"min-width: 800px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Date</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Time</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Location</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th style=\"width: 100px\"></th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<time class=\"date\" datetime=\"2025-05-05\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t            <strong>Monday 05 May</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t        </time>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"14:00\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t            14:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\