ofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"gViykORi95M\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/limonov.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gViykORi95M&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Limonov: The Ballad of Eddie</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Limonov: The Ballad of Eddie</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Fri 09 to Sat 17 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Festivals &amp; Series\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/beyond-words/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Beyond Words\">\n\t\t                    \tBeyond Words\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Presented in competition at the 2024 Cannes Film Festival, Serebrennikov’s latest film is based on the novel<em> Limonov</em> by acclaimed French writer Emmanuel Carrère.</p>\n<p>A revolutionary militant, a thug, an underground writer, a butler, a millionaire in Manhattan, and also a switchblade waving poet, a lover of beautiful women, a warmonger, a political agitator and a novelist who wrote of his own greatness, Eduard Limonov’s life story is a controversial journey through Russia, America and Europe during the second half of the 20th century.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKirill Serebrennikov\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBen Whishaw, Viktoria Miroshnichenko, Tomas Arana\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tITA/FRA/SPAIN | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t138 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tin English, Russian, French, Spanish with EN subs\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-09\">\n\t                Friday 09 May\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"20:15\">\n\t            20:15\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6260925.TcsSection_1928774\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    \t<a href=\"#more-dates\" title=\"Check more dates\" data-fancybox class=\"button button-arrow button-outline\">Check more dates</a>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"more\" id=\"more-dates\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>More Showings</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"desktop\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"min-width: 800px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Date</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Time</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\