scription\" content=\"Leni Riefenstahl, the director of Triumph of the Will and Olympia, is considered one of the most controversial photography and film figures of the twentieth century. How could Riefenstahl rise to become the Reich’s leading filmmaker while persistently denying any close ties to Hitler and Goebbels? The film explores this question using only documents from [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/riefenstahl.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/\",\"name\":\"Riefenstahl at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/riefenstahl.jpg\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-03-31T11:52:32+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/riefenstahl/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadActi