/div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">A Monster in Paris</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>A Monster in Paris</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Sun 11 to Sat 17 May</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    CinéFamilies\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/stage-on-screen/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Stage on Screen\">\n\t\t                    \tStage on Screen\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>This tribute to both <em>Beauty &amp; the Beast</em> and <em>The Phantom of the Opera transports</em> us to the Paris of 1910 where cabaret singer Lucille (Vanessa Paradis) finds herself face-to-face with a giant flea: the &#8220;Monster of Paris&#8221;(Mathieu Chedid/Sean Lennon). After realising the Monster is actually a kind soul and a very good singer, Lucille decides to hide him and there’s no better place to do that than by singing his heart out on the famous stage of the Rare Bird cabaret!</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBibo Bergeron\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMatthieu Chedid, Vanessa Paradis, Sean Lennon\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-film-line\"></i> Original title: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUn Monstre a Paris\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t90 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn English\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tU\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-05-11\">\n\t                Sunday 11 May\t            </time>\n\t              