ais · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The hopelessly clumsy yet charming and full of contradictions Agathe finds herself in desperate singlehood. Her dream is to experience love akin to a Jane Austen novel and her ultimate aspiration is to become a writer. Instead, she spends her days selling books in the legendary British Bookshop, Shakespeare &amp; Co, in Paris. Invited to [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-04-03T10:44:28+00:00\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1440\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"660\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Estimated reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/\",\"url\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/\",\"name\":\"Jane Austen Wrecked My Life at Ciné Lumière - Institut Français · Royaume-Uni\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/jane-austen-wrecked-my-life/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/ja